# Package F "A Holiday on Ice": Nueman hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice), holiday_on_ice_paid, holiday_on_ice_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('holiday_on_ice_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('holiday_on_ice_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice)') && HasItem('pump_specs')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Orbital Air wants a look at a new cold-pumping design. BAT is testing it. An engineer, Morrow, carries the specs to and from the lab in a briefcase.
#
o_text: Go on.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: Pose as an inspector, or don't. Get me the specs. Four-fifty. It's just industrial espionage, nobody gets hurt.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Morrow. Corporate district. The briefcase.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He doesn't even open them.) Good. Very good.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 450 sat, as agreed.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Four-fifty. (He leaves fast.) If anyone asks, you never met an Orbital Air agent. Which is true.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'pump_specs', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 450)
effect: SetFlag('holiday_on_ice_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Morrow's specs went to the other buyer. (He smiles too much.) You're learning.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: Nueman? Never heard of him.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Cold out today.
effect: EndConversation
